    <Placemark>
      <name>Eva Kestner International Taiko Drum Academy</name>
      <description>90-minute hands-on taiko workshop or private lesson with professional bilingual taiko drummer Eva Kestner.

Why: Probably the strongest lesson option for a musically interested parent and teen: Eva teaches in English, works with beginners and experienced players, and teaches children as young as four. The emphasis is on actual technique, rhythm and playing rather than simply a tourist demonstration.

Drums / Do / Daikanyama
(pin is area-level, not the exact address)
https://www.eva-kestner.com/lessons</description>
      <styleUrl>#theme-drums</styleUrl>
      <Point><coordinates>139.703,35.651,0</coordinates></Point>
